  "id": "app/",
  "name": "BANTA-Y: dengue watch for barangays",
  "short_name": "BANTA-Y",
  "description": "Ranks dengue hotspots by where people spend the day, finds the least-cost vector-control plan with a certified gap, traces cases from home addresses to places of infection, and raises an early CUSUM alarm. Works offline.",
